  "description": "Preview, not production ready. PostgreSQL adapter for AgentExperience.NET: persists canonical, scoped Experience Records through the IExperienceRecordStore port with plain Npgsql, host-authorization checks before any database access, exact scope predicates applied in SQL, and a journaled schema migration runner over embedded, versioned scripts. Requires Npgsql 10.0.3, dbup-postgresql 7.0.1, and dbup-core 6.1.1 or later within the same major.",
